          "text": "Patient-reported left eye symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Much improved. Was really scratchy on Monday and is now just a bit irritating. No increased pain, no photophobia, and no decrease in vision from usual; blurry without glasses is unchanged from usual. No mucopurulent discharge, only watery tearing. No foreign body since the original event. No contact lens use."
